sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/darwin1859-ch04-12> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch04-12--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch04-12--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on darwin1859-ch04-12: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.66" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.1.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.662"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.66"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "Prolonged selfing or asexuality leaves genomic signatures, and the decisive lineages plus a sexual-system database are public. A universal claim can be challenged by those lineages without sequencing every hermaphrodite, but the flagship cases remain ambiguous because cryptic sex is hard to exclude. The analysis is standard for a small team and still short of a clean confirmation or refutation across plants and animals." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: For hermaphrodites and candidate ancient asexuals, test genomes for meiosis genes, allele divergence, and the age of asexuality. The claim would be confirmed if every well-sampled lineage shows occasional outcrossing or a recent loss of sex. It would be refuted by a lineage that has persisted for many millions of years with no sex and no genomic sign of decline that an occasional cross would be needed to prevent." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Rare sex, gene conversion, and horizontal transfer can mimic or mask long-term asexuality.", "Many hermaphrodites still lack genomes dense enough for a Meselson-effect test.", "Indispensable is a fitness claim that extant genomes record only indirectly." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch04-12--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch04-12--grok--dataset-2>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/darwin1859-ch04-12--grok--dataset-3> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch04-12--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of darwin1859-ch04-12 by Grok 4.7: 0.7" ;
